{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"群"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>群记录了对称性, 也即范畴中的对象的自同构.</p>\n<p>相关讲义: "},{"Local":{"url":"GrpAni","text":"生象群"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n"}]}}